1 NAME Jens /Jensen Bloch/
2 GIVN Jens
2 SURN Jensen Bloch
2 _MARNM Jensen Bloch
2 NICK Ioannes Ioannis Wiburgensis
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1599
