2 CONT  Karen Jacobsdatter Birth: estimated between 1575 and 1635 	Daughter of Jacob Wognsen, i Aalborg and Karen Nielsdatter Wife of Morten Madsen Bloch Mother of Søren Mortensen Bryndum, and Inger Mortensdatter Brøndum Sister of Christ
2 CONC en Jacobsen; Vogn Jacobsen; Sidsel Jacobsdatter and Peder Jacobsen 
