2 CONT
2 CONT Stygge Mogensen Haasum - Clara Hansen Sedgedorph Stygge Mogensen Haasum was born at Haasum, Viborg, Denmark 14 Dec 1637. His parents were Mogens Jensen and Anne Knudsdatter. He married Clara Hansen Sedgedorph Abt 1666 at of Simest
2 CONC ad, Viborg, Denmark . Clara Hansen Sedgedorph was born at of Simestad, Viborg, Denmark 1630 daughter of Hans Sedgedorph and Mrs. Hans Sedgedorph .
2 CONT
2 CONT They were the parents of 2 children: Jens Styggesen Haasum born Abt 1665. Anne Catherine Styggesdatter Haasum born Abt 1667. Stygge Mogensen Haasum died 15 Feb 1703 at Simestad, Viborg, Denmark .
2 CONT
2 CONT Clara Hansen Sedgedorph died 9 Mar 1706 at Simestad, Viborg, Denmark .
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT *  6. 9/7 1667*. Styge Mogensen Haasum af Haasum-R., f. 14/12 37; St. Vibg. 60; ~ F. E., † 9/3 06; 2 S., 1 D.; [† 15/2 1703].
2 CONT
2 CONT KUM I, s. 286 (»Stygæus Magni Hosumius«); Sixhøj nr. 350, 354.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://wiberg-net.dk/1002-03-Simested.htm#JensLauritsen
2 CONT
