3 CITY Kragerø
1 OCCU gift 1753, Døde sansynligvis under fødselen.Giftemålet framgår av Kragerø kirkebok nr 1 fra 6.11.1753
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gjertrud Marie Mikkelsdatter Mandt was born in 1719, probably in Kristiansand. She was recorded as being a witness or godmother at baptisms in Vinje in the years1739, 1746, 1748, and 1752. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1753 at 34 years of age, she married Frantz JohannesenCudrio (1703-1758), a widowed goldsmith in the seacoast town of Kragerø. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gjertrud Marie died giving birth to a daughter, Anna Catrine Sparre. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gjertrud was buried inKragerø, 31 March l757. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Baby Anna Catrine was baptized 1 April 1757. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Frantz himselflived only one year more, and so little Anna then lived with her mother’s family until her own death, just before her third birthday. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The Cudrio property was transferred to Mikkel Mandt, then to Engelbret Resen Mandt as Anna Catrine’s legal guardian on 14 December 1761. (Mandt, K.O.)
