1 NOTE Alderman Christen (Mortensen) Hegelund  was born about 1470. He died2,3  in 1500/1510 in Viborg, Denmark. He married Agnes (Offens) Pedersdatter (Sochfod). 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a Citizen in Viborg. "Viborg Kjøbstads Historie" says, in connection with Aldermen, " Peder 
2 CONT Christensen Hegelund, 1550-1589. He replaced Jens Kat. He was Mayor with Niels Andersen until 1571. 
2 CONT After that he was Mayor with Gunde Skriver.
