1 NOTE Mayor Jens Christensen Hegelund  was born about 1512 in Viborg, Jutland, Denmark. He died2,3  on 18 Mar 1571 in Ribe, Ribe Amt, Denmark. He was buried on 21 Mar 1571 in Ribe Cathedral, Ribe, Ribe Amt,>
2 CONT  Denmark. He married Marie (Anna?) Pedersdatter about 1541. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was first named in the records in 1541. He moved from Viborg to Ribe, where he became an 
2 CONT Alderman from 1544 to 1554. He was Mayor from 1554 until his death. Until the Nordic Seven Years' 
2 CONT War broke out, he was an extremely well to do man.
