1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://finnholbek.dk/getperson.php?personID=I25475&tree=2
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans Mørch
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans Laursen Mørk
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref:   Kilder: CK10-KS1-sMø-sHo- 
2 CONT
