1 NOTE 	Povl Fechtel  was born after 1500 in Hamburg, Germany. He died shortly after Sep 1599 in Copenhagen, Denmark. He married Marine Davidsdatter about 1545. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1536 he was recorded in Elsinore, Denmark. He was made "Møntmester" (Royal Master of the Mint) 
2 CONT and a merchant in Copenhagen in 1541. He held that position until 1565. He was still alive in 1590.
