1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT From Mo Bygdebok, Volume II, Skafså Sokn, page 186:    Tarjei Petterson Mandt N. Åmli* (1766-1825) married Gro Tarjeisdatter Rørtveit* (1776-1838). We find them in 1801 on Napen*. There Tarjei was a tenant farmer. Later they lived
2 CONC  on Tveito*, Moen under North Åmli*, Kolkjøn*, Leistehaugen* and Sundet*, but Tarjei died at Lone*. The widow came to live with her son on Napen*.    *Farm names in Skafså Sokn.      
